      "Edit reaction_types[*].reactants.<slot> lists directly (add/remove compound IDs like 'Ar-OMs').",
      "Use reactants.nucleophiles as the second-component list for cross-couplings (e.g., organoboron, terminal alkyne, alkene) and for classical nucleophiles (amines, alcohols, thiols).",
      "motif_sets are optional convenience lists; you may copy them into reactants slots and customize per reaction."
